for free does not make its use noncommercial when it is intended to obtain
commercial advantage.

The fee, permitted scope, term, and any agreed exceptions to sections 3 or 4
are set out in that separate agreement. Neither a public acknowledgment nor
a support payment alone grants commercial permission. For inquiries, contact
harnakam through https://github.com/harnakam/POW.

